       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WVLOAD.
      *****************************************************************
      * A FLAT BUFFER, THEN AN 01 THAT REDEFINES IT WITH A TYPED     *
      * LAYOUT OF TWO 03 GROUPS.  Card-image fixed format: 01 in     *
      * Area A (column 8), each 05's PICTURE on the following line.  *
      * The changing field (WV-VALUE) is in the SECOND 03.  The      *
      * trace climbs 05 -> 03 -> 01, crosses the REDEFINES, and      *
      * judges WV-DATA (4096 bytes) already big enough - a note,     *
      * not a change.                                                *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL BEGIN DECLARE SECTION END-EXEC.
       EJECT
      **************************************************************
      *                                                          *
      *              APPLICATION  DATA  BLOCK                     *
      *                                                          *
      **************************************************************
       01  WV-DATA                                  PIC X(4096).
       01  WV-CUTBLA-VIEW REDEFINES WV-DATA.
           03  WV-CUTBLA-HDR.
               05  WV-REC-TYPE
                               PIC X(02).
               05  WV-REC-SEQ
                               PIC 9(06).
           03  WV-CUTBLA-KEY.
               05  WV-VALUE
                               PIC S9(10)V9(2).
               05  WV-CUST-NAME
                               PIC X(30).
           EXEC SQL END DECLARE SECTION END-EXEC.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT CB_VALUE, CB_NAME
                 INTO :WV-VALUE, :WV-CUST-NAME
                 FROM CUTBLA
                WHERE CB_ID = 1
           END-EXEC
           STOP RUN.
